        (0, v1) -> k1 * k2
    camlLengths__length_from_0_1 = closure Lengths.length_from_0 of
      {Lengths.length_from_0 = camlLengths__length_from_0_2_code}
      at {Lengths.length_from_0 = camlLengths__length_from_0_1} {}
    camlLengths__length_1_2 = closure Lengths.length_1 of
      {Lengths.length_1 = camlLengths__length_1_3_code}
      at {Lengths.length_1 = camlLengths__length_1_2} {}
    camlLengths = Block 0 (camlLengths__length_from_0_1,
      camlLengths__length_1_2)
  before Simplify, after the prefix (10 steps): returns [0: <fun>; <fun>]
  after Simplify, after the prefix (2 steps): returns [0: <fun>; <fun>]
